mcap"},{"id":619474658,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MTk0NzQ2NTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/labels/bug-regression","name":"bug-regression","color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":"wrong behavior that was introduced in a previous commit (please bisect)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/17","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/milestone/17","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/17/labels","id":2844524,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMjg0NDUyNA==","number":17,"title":"0.2.2","description":"","creator":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":14,"state":"closed","created_at":"2017-10-17T20:46:33Z","updated_at":"2018-04-07T14:29:21Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2017-11-18T23:02:08Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2017-11-16T22:44:40Z","updated_at":"2017-11-18T22:43:46Z","closed_at":"2017-11-18T11:34:04Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using neovim 0.2.1 in combination with gnome-terminal switching between tabs (and possibly other window related operations) results in the memory of gnome-terminal-server increasing quite rapidly. I ran into this when at some point the total memory used was around 2 GB, when normally gnome-terminal-server hardly goes above 100 MB.\r\n\r\nI did some manual testing with other terminals (e.g. tilix and roxterm) and they seem to suffer from the same problem. I haven't tested non libvte terminals though. Seeing how the nvim process itself is not increasing in memory usage I think neovim is spitting something out these terminals don't like.\r\n\r\nNeovim 0.2.0 does not suffer from the mentioned problem.\r\n\r\n- `nvim --version`: v0.2.1\r\n- Vim (version: ) behaves differently?\r\n- Operating system/version: Arch Linux, kernel 4.9 LTS\r\n- Terminal name/version: gnome-terminal 3.26.2 VTE version 0.50.2\r\n- `$TERM`: xterm-256color\r\n\r\n### Requirements To Reproduce\r\n\r\n* Python 3\r\n* gnome-terminal\r\n* https://github.com/neovim/python-client installed\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. `curl -s https://gist.githubusercontent.com/YorickPeterse/ec9262060d4aaaff48e7304e8cc14034/raw/2e79bd1dc3bd023a6cd9ff09eae1c54113f67ba0/reproduce.vim -o /tmp/reproduce.vim`\r\n2. `curl -s https://gist.githubusercontent.com/YorickPeterse/ec9262060d4aaaff48e7304e8cc14034/raw/2e79bd1dc3bd023a6cd9ff09eae1c54113f67ba0/reproduce.py -o /tmp/reproduce.py`\r\n3. Run `env NVIM_LISTEN_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1:9999 nvim -u /tmp/reproduce.vim` in one gnome-terminal instance\r\n4. Run `python /tmp/reproduce.py` (requires python 3) in another instance\r\n5. Wait until the Python script completes\r\n\r\n### Actual behaviour\r\n\r\nMemory of gnome-terminal-server (but weirdly enough not nvim itself) increases over time.\r\n\r\nOn 0.2.0 the script output is:\r\n\r\n```\r\nMemory start: 89.63671875 MB\r\nMemory increase: 0.0 MB\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn 0.2.1:\r\n\r\n```\r\nMemory start: 90.5625 MB\r\nMemory increase: 45.60546875 MB\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behaviour\r\n\r\nMemory does not increase drastically.","closed_by":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/7573/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/7573/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}